{"id":"53b1ce86-b88f-4ba4-a215-a4bcd514a4ec","createdAt":"2026-10-26T11:59:31.835Z","batchId":"pricing_deepseek-v4-1-flash-gateway_low","approach":"html","modelId":"deepseek-v4.1-flash-gateway","settings":{"effort":"low"},"presetId":"pricing","prompt":"A pricing page with three plans (Free, Pro, Team), their features and a call to action for each.","system":"Return only the body content of an HTML page: no doctype, <html>, <head> or <body> tags, no markdown, no code fences, no prose. The page shell below is already loaded, so build with its classes and chart helper. Inline <script> is allowed for interactivity (tabs, toggles, filters); no external requests. Add a small <style> block only for what the classes cannot express, or when the request asks for a different look, colours, fonts or layout: then follow the request.\nPAGE SHELL (already loaded; do not restate it):\n- A stylesheet with these classes. Use them instead of writing CSS:\n  layout: page (centered column), stack, row, between, center, gap-sm, gap-lg, grid + cols-2|cols-3|cols-4 (responsive)\n  surfaces: card, card-title, card-desc, alert, alert-destructive, hr\n  text: h1-h4 (styled), lead, muted, small, up, down (trend colours)\n  controls: btn, btn-secondary|btn-outline|btn-ghost|btn-destructive, btn-sm|btn-lg, btn-block; label wraps input/select/textarea; label.check wraps a checkbox or radio\n  data: table (styled; td.num for numbers), badge, badge-secondary|badge-outline|badge-destructive, stat-label, stat-value, progress (inner div with style=\"width:NN%\"), avatar\n- Charts: <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar|line|area|pie\",\"title\":\"…\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"W1\",\"value\":120}]}'></div> renders an SVG chart (single series, pie gets a legend). Do not draw charts yourself.\n- Light and dark mode are handled by the stylesheet.\n\nDESIGN BRIEF (applies to every UI you produce):\n- Build a complete, realistic screen, not a skeleton: a clear title and intro, grouped sections, and enough detail that it could ship.\n- Cover exactly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".","systemHash":"0c16911c9564c3db3ada7a622931ee6ffc820ebf9a373996782a9f1f0fc3c98c","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<div class=\"page stack gap-lg\">\n  <header class=\"stack\" style=\"text-align:center; max-width: 46rem; margin-inline: auto;\">\n    <h1>Simple pricing that scales with you</h1>\n    <p class=\"lead\">Start free, upgrade when your work grows. Every plan includes unlimited collaborators on shared docs and no setup fees — cancel anytime.</p>\n    <div class=\"row center gap-sm\" style=\"justify-content:center; flex-wrap:wrap;\">\n      <div class=\"seg\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Billing period\">\n        <button type=\"button\" data-mode=\"monthly\" aria-pressed=\"true\">Monthly</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" data-mode=\"annual\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Annual</button>\n      </div>\n      <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">Save 20% with annual</span>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"small muted\" id=\"billingNote\">Prices in USD. Annual billing is charged once per year.</p>\n  </header>\n\n  <div class=\"grid cols-3 gap-lg\">\n    <!-- Free -->\n    <section class=\"card stack gap-sm plan\">\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <h3>Free</h3>\n        <p class=\"small muted\">For individuals kicking the tires on a side project.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"row\" style=\"align-items:baseline; gap:.35rem;\">\n        <span class=\"price-amount\">$0</span>\n        <span class=\"small muted\">forever</span>\n      </div>\n      <a class=\"btn btn-outline btn-block\" href=\"#free\">Get started free</a>\n      <p class=\"small muted\">No credit card required.</p>\n      <hr>\n      <ul class=\"feature-list\">\n        <li>3 projects</li>\n        <li>1 GB file storage</li>\n        <li>Basic usage analytics</li>\n        <li>7-day version history</li>\n        <li>Community support</li>\n      </ul>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Pro -->\n    <section class=\"card stack gap-sm plan plan-popular\">\n      <div class=\"row between\" style=\"align-items:flex-start;\">\n        <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n          <h3>Pro</h3>\n          <p class=\"small muted\">For freelancers and makers shipping real work.</p>\n        </div>\n        <span class=\"badge\">Most popular</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"row\" style=\"align-items:baseline; gap:.35rem;\">\n        <span class=\"price-amount\" data-price data-monthly=\"$19\" data-annual=\"$15\">$19</span>\n        <span class=\"small muted paid-period\" data-period data-monthly=\"/mo billed monthly\" data-annual=\"/mo billed annually\">/mo billed monthly</span>\n      </div>\n      <a class=\"btn btn-block\" href=\"#pro\">Start 14-day free trial</a>\n      <p class=\"small muted\">Then <span class=\"paid-total\" data-total data-monthly=\"$228 per year\" data-annual=\"$180 per year, billed once\">$228 per year</span>. Cancel anytime.</p>\n      <hr>\n      <ul class=\"feature-list\">\n        <li>Unlimited projects</li>\n        <li>50 GB file storage</li>\n        <li>Advanced analytics &amp; exports</li>\n        <li>1-year version history</li>\n        <li>Custom domains &amp; branding</li>\n        <li>REST API access — 10k calls/mo</li>\n        <li>Priority email support</li>\n      </ul>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Team -->\n    <section class=\"card stack gap-sm plan\">\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <h3>Team</h3>\n        <p class=\"small muted\">For growing teams that need control and auditability.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"row\" style=\"align-items:baseline; gap:.35rem;\">\n        <span class=\"price-amount\" data-price data-monthly=\"$49\" data-annual=\"$39\">$49</span>\n        <span class=\"small muted paid-period\" data-period data-monthly=\"/seat/mo billed monthly\" data-annual=\"/seat/mo billed annually\">/seat/mo billed monthly</span>\n      </div>\n      <a class=\"btn btn-secondary btn-block\" href=\"#team\">Start 14-day free trial</a>\n      <p class=\"small muted\">Then <span class=\"paid-total\" data-total data-monthly=\"$588 per seat per year\" data-annual=\"$468 per seat per year, billed once\">$588 per seat per year</span>. Minimum 3 seats.</p>\n      <hr>\n      <ul class=\"feature-list\">\n        <li>Everything in Pro, plus:</li>\n        <li>250 GB pooled storage</li>\n        <li>SSO &amp; SAML 2.0</li>\n        <li>Role-based permissions</li>\n        <li>Audit logs — 24-month retention</li>\n        <li>API access — 100k calls/mo</li>\n        <li>99.9% uptime SLA</li>\n        <li>Dedicated success manager</li>\n      </ul>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n\n  <section class=\"card stack\">\n    <div class=\"row between\" style=\"flex-wrap:wrap; gap:.5rem;\">\n      <h3 class=\"card-title\">Compare plans</h3>\n      <p class=\"small muted\">All prices in USD, excluding tax where applicable.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"overflow-x:auto;\">\n      <table>\n        <thead>\n          <tr>\n            <th>Feature</th>\n            <th class=\"num\">Free</th>\n            <th class=\"num\">Pro</th>\n            <th class=\"num\">Team</th>\n          </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr><td>Projects</td><td class=\"num\">3</td><td class=\"num\">Unlimited</td><td class=\"num\">Unlimited</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>File storage</td><td class=\"num\">1 GB</td><td class=\"num\">50 GB</td><td class=\"num\">250 GB pooled</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Version history</td><td class=\"num\">7 days</td><td class=\"num\">1 year</td><td class=\"num\">2 years</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Analytics &amp; exports</td><td class=\"num\">Basic</td><td class=\"num\">Advanced</td><td class=\"num\">Advanced</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Custom domains</td><td class=\"num\">—</td><td class=\"num\">✓</td><td class=\"num\">✓</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>API access</td><td class=\"num\">—</td><td class=\"num\">10k calls/mo</td><td class=\"num\">100k calls/mo</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>SSO &amp; SAML</td><td class=\"num\">—</td><td class=\"num\">—</td><td class=\"num\">✓</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Role-based permissions</td><td class=\"num\">—</td><td class=\"num\">—</td><td class=\"num\">✓</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Audit logs</td><td class=\"num\">—</td><td class=\"num\">—</td><td class=\"num\">✓</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Uptime SLA</td><td class=\"num\">—</td><td class=\"num\">—</td><td class=\"num\">99.9%</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Support</td><td class=\"num\">Community</td><td class=\"num\">Priority email</td><td class=\"num\">Email + success manager</td></tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <div class=\"alert\">\n    <strong>Try any paid plan for 14 days, free.</strong> No charge during the trial, and you can downgrade to Free at any point — your projects stay intact.\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<style>\n  .plan { justify-content: flex-start; }\n  .plan-popular { outline: 2px solid rgba(127,127,127,.45); outline-offset: 2px; }\n  .price-amount { font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -.02em; }\n  .feature-list { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: grid; gap: .5rem; }\n  .feature-list li { display: flex; gap: .55rem; align-items: flex-start; font-size: .9rem; line-height: 1.4; }\n  .feature-list li::before { content: \"✓\"; font-weight: 700; color: #22c55e; flex: none; }\n  .seg { display: inline-flex; gap: 4px; padding: 4px; border-radius: 999px; background: rgba(127,127,127,.15); }\n  .seg button { border: 0; background: transparent; color: inherit; font: inherit; font-size: .875rem; padding: .4rem .9rem; border-radius: 999px; cursor: pointer; opacity: .7; }\n  .seg button[aria-pressed=\"true\"] { background: rgba(127,127,127,.35); opacity: 1; font-weight: 600; }\n  .seg button:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid currentColor; outline-offset: 2px; }\n</style>\n\n<script>\n  (function () {\n    var note = document.getElementById('billingNote');\n\n    function setBilling(mode) {\n      document.querySelectorAll('.seg button').forEach(function (btn) {\n        btn.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(btn.dataset.mode === mode));\n      });\n      document.querySelectorAll('[data-price], [data-period], [data-total]').forEach(function (el) {\n        var v = mode === 'annual' ? el.dataset.annual : el.dataset.monthly;\n        if (v) el.textContent = v;\n      });\n      note.textContent = mode === 'annual'\n        ? 'Prices in USD. Annual plans are billed once per year — that is 20% less than monthly.'\n        : 'Prices in USD. Monthly plans renew each month until cancelled.';\n    }\n\n    document.querySelectorAll('.seg button').forEach(function (btn) {\n      btn.addEventListener('click', function () { setBilling(btn.dataset.mode); });\n    });\n  })();\n</script>","deltas":[[9458,"<div"],[9510," class"],[9510,"=\""],[9510,"page"],[9510," stack"],[9510," gap"],[9510,"-lg"],[9510,"\">\n"],[9510," "],[9510," <"],[9510,"header"],[9549," class"],[9549,"=\""],[9549,"stack"],[9549,"\""],[9549," style"],[9549,"=\""],[9549,"text"],[9550,"-align"],[9550,":"],[9550,"center"],[9550,";"],[9550," max"],[9550,"-width"],[9550,":"],[9550," "],[9595,"46"],[9596,"rem"],[9596,";"],[9596," margin"],[9596,"-in"],[9608,"line"],[9608,":"],[9608," auto"],[9608,";\">\n"],[9608,"   "],[9608," <"],[9608,"h"],[9608,"1"],[9608,">"],[9608,"Si